caption: City Baseline

LOCKED: Furui Tokyo is the Greater Tokyo metropolitan region from approximately 2135, displaced into the wider GATES setting. The current campaign year for Furui Tokyo is 2436.

LOCKED: Furui Tokyo contains approximately 70 million residents and includes the Tokyo–Yokohama–Saitama–Chiba metropolitan system.

LOCKED: Use approximately 13,500 square kilometres as the Furui Tokyo metropolitan-state footprint.

LOCKED: Furui Tokyo is uniformly TL10, with limited TL11 strategic systems.

LOCKED: Before the catastrophe, Furui Tokyo is Low Mana and SPAA 2.

LOCKED: The city has repeatedly rebuilt after kaiju attacks, dimensional incidents, supernatural disasters, and Gate phenomena. It possesses extensive automated emergency response, dense Wasp Drone defenses, conventional military forces, Sentai-style defenders, and other superhuman protectors.
